     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi All,<br><br>I have a very basic script with which I am currently facing problem:<div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:#000\">shinyServer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> session</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span></code></pre></div></code></div><br><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shinythemes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>shinyUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">navbarPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;My Electronic CV&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> theme </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> shinytheme</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;readable&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> inverse </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        tabPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Overview Section&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            fluidRow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                column</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">width </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                    </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;4&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                </span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                column</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">width </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> offset </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                    </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;3 offset 2&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#closing bracket for fluidRow</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#closing bracket for tabPanel</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#closing bracket for navbarPage</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#800\">#closing bracket for shinyUI</span></code></pre></div></code></div><br><br></div><div>The error I get is the following:<br><br><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"color:#606\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> column</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">width </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;4&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> unused argument </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">width </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></font><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br>I have absolutely no idea why this error occurs. My guess is perhaps my use of column() within navbarPage() function, but that surely should not be happening, as it seems logical to nest columns in a NavBar Page.<br><br>Any help, please?<br>Much appreciated.<br><br></div><div><br><pre style=\"margin-bottom:1em;padding:5px;overflow:auto;width:auto;max-height:600px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace,sans-serif;color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal;background-color:rgb(238,238,238)\"><br></pre></div></div>"
